d 400 items using it without getting banned, by mistake I executed the script multiple times which got me to being banned. This goes to show that you need to be extra careful. I recommend using it on an alt, and then trade the wanted items to your main.\n\n--> Features:\n  --> Slowly: The script will have pretty high delay in collecting items, but despite looking bad, it still collects a pretty high amount over time.\n  --> Blanks: The script sometimes will intentionally not collect the item in order to decrease the risk.\n  --> QoL: Instead of the game itself, the screen will be covered with the HsB UI, which will also tell you how much items you've collected (Beware that the number displayed may not be 100% accurate, will be fixed in next updates)\n  --> Redirect: If the script will throw an error, you will be informed about it, and also with a simple instruction to what to do next.","tags":["Arcane Odyssey","Arcane Odyssey Auto Farm","Arcane Odyssey Item Farm","AO Item Farm","AO"],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"6501f01891ccd257377815bc","username":"senS","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/80ddca4c39cc0975301001eef77a332af954359c2aa6955355398811374f42d3.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6501f01891ccd257377815bc-1695153486831.png"},"status":"offline","id":"6501f01891ccd257377815bc","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.views","tier":1000000},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/80ddca4c39cc0975301001eef77a332af954359c2aa6955355398811374f42d3.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6501f01891ccd257377815bc-1695153486831.png"}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-19T23:23:32.082Z","last":"","win":14,"math":3},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"67e5e1e5b360710ec3c513d2","editBy":{"_id":"6501f01891ccd257377815bc","userna